{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-fia","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"fia-nshama-town-square","about":"FIA is an ultra-modern development by Emaar subsidiary Nshama, located in the picturesque Town Square neighbourhood. The complex is a 19-storey building and offers luxury apartments with 1-3 bedrooms. Each residence has thoughtfully designed functional layouts and elegant interiors with light colours and the highest quality materials. The windows offer mesmerising views of the park or the neighbourhood's surroundings.The unique amenities of the complex will allow residents to enjoy leisure and comfort without travelling outside the community. Residents will find a large swimming pool, fully equipped gymnasium, basketball courts, football pitch, cycling tracks, jogging tracks, tennis court, children's play areas, shops and supermarkets, and a large Town Square park with recreational areas.One of the features of Fia is its unique location. Its location close to the main thoroughfares of the city provides quick access to the main social and recreational infrastructure. Fia is a unique development that is ideal for those looking for a comfortable and modern lifestyle away from the bustling metropolis.","price":782888,"title":"FIA","bitrix":{"id":480,"pf_id":"are.2.13653","source":null,"project_id":"FIA","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Town Square","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Nshama","project_location":"Town Square"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1416/images/2024/03/18/340x252/8B3cLBoMZrdVvuh0RgkYniqHqXFB56DOGgSEFlL5.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1416/images/2024/03/18/464x312/8B3cLBoMZrdVvuh0RgkYniqHqXFB56DOGgSEFlL5.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0056547,"lng":55.2875504},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/14